; A periodic transaction with a period of zero units is rejected when the
; journal is read; it used to hang once --forecast expanded it.

~ every 0 months
    Expenses:Rent    $500.00
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test reg --forecast 'd<[2025]' --now 2024/06/01 -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 4:
While parsing periodic transaction:
> ~ every 0 months
Error: Invalid period length: 0
end test
